OL,3,GNEWSAFive taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ahundreds of teens at party
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people were taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter hundreds of teenagers gathered
OL,8,Ffor a party in East Sussex.
OL,10,FSussex Police said it was called to
OL,11,Freports of about 300 teenagers at a
OL,12,Fparty in Wall Farm Lane, Rye, at about
OL,13,F21:30 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,15,FSouth East Coast Ambulance Service said
OL,16,Fit sent crews and specialist response
OL,17,Fteams who assessed six people at the
OL,18,Fscene. Five were taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
